Z||000006||AusFiero||08-01-2001||08:00 AM||||Heheheh a hippy. Don't tell 84bill. He has this thing about hippies on the runway. Must be a throwback to his days partaking in the substances the hippies couldn't afford  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Notice the GM part of that t-bird. The roof is 2 1959 Cadillac rear window and roof sections welded together. Headlights are Hyundai Excel (Owner was tempted to put a coffe can exhaust after that for some reason but controlled himself  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) tail lights are custom made 1 offs. Interior, well Iam not sure if I personally like the dash but the rest I do like.||||reg||1
